  {
    "index": 8,
    "hash": "jJBO90rGlRzv6vWrMoE+kQfg5HI=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-13T14:13:55.296Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "**Connect** is the Powerhouse host application that serves as a container for all Powerhouse apps and drives. It provides:\n\n- A runtime environment for document editors and drive apps\n- Document drive management (local and remote drives)\n- Integration with Vetra Studio (the builder platform)\n- Built-in Tailwind CSS for styling\n- Document toolbar with standard actions (save, share, navigation)\n\nConnect is launched via `ph connect` -- which defaults to the `studio` subcommand, so `ph connect` and `ph connect studio` are equivalent -- or as part of the full local stack started by `ph vetra --watch`. It typically runs at `http://localhost:3000/`.\n\nIn the context of development, Connect/Vetra provides a live preview environment where editors update dynamically as you make changes to the code.\n\n_Corrected 2026-08-13 against Powerhouse v6.2.2-dev.45._",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-13T14:13:28.000Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-13T14:13:55.296Z"
    }
  },
